# Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6 - Epic Wild Feats
# Pages 103-105

Epic Wild Shape	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Wild	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.WildShape	PREPCLEVEL:MIN=21	DESC:Additional wild shape uses per day and access to more powerful forms.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.103
Improved Wild Shape Duration	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Wild	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.WildShape	DESC:Wild shape duration doubles.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.103
Fast Wild Shape	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Wild	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.WildShape	DESC:Use wild shape as a move action instead of standard action.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.103
Instantaneous Wild Shape	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Wild	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Fast Wild Shape	DESC:Use wild shape as a swift action.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.103
Greater Wild Shape	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Wild	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.WildShape	PREPCLEVEL:MIN=21	DESC:Assume any creature form matching your wild shape options, regardless of size. Gain all extraordinary and supernatural abilities.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.103
Magical Wild Shape	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Wild	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Greater Wild Shape	DESC:Cast spells with verbal and somatic components while in wild shape.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
Wild Mastery	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Wild	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.WildShape	PREPCLEVEL:MIN=25	DESC:Wild shape into Plant, Elemental, Magical Beast, Aberration, Dragon, or Fey types.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
Perfect Wild Shape	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Wild	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Wild Mastery	PREPCLEVEL:MIN=30	DESC:Assume form of any living creature with no type restriction. Gain all extraordinary, spell-like, and supernatural abilities.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.105
Eternal Wild Shape	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Wild	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Improved Wild Shape Duration	DESC:Wild shape duration becomes permanent until dismissed.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
Wild Healing	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Wild	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,TYPE.WildShape	PRESTAT:1,WIS=23	DESC:When you wild shape, heal 1d8 hit points per druid level. Once per use of wild shape.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.105
